OL,5,G0000 Freak Zone Playlist
OL,6,     FSwedish composer and soundartist
OL,7,     FMaria W Horn chooses an hour of
OL,8,     Fmusic that effects our perception
OL,9,     Fof time and space.
OL,10,G0100 My Top Twelve: Cass Elliot
OL,11,     FIn a programme recorded just
OL,12,     Ftwelve days before she died, Cass
OL,13,     FElliot of The Mamas and The Papas
OL,14,     Ftalks to Brian Matthew about her
OL,15,     Fcareer and favourite records.
OL,16,G0200 My Top Twelve: Joni Mitchell
OL,17,     FJoni Mitchell joins host Andy
OL,18,     FPeebles to share a playlist of 12
OL,19,     Fdefining tracks, discussing how
OL,20,     Fartists from Miles Davis to Edith
OL,21,     FPiaf shaped her music.
